+# Agent Mod Requests
+
+## 2026-10-25: Parallel Test Execution Resource Throttling
+
+- **Observation:** `npm test` runs vitest with `--project unit --project integration --project chaos` all in parallel, spawning dozens of child git processes simultaneously. On local developer machines, this can lead to test runner timeouts due to CPU/file lock contention.
+- **Request / Recommendation:** Provide fine-grained test runner flags or test isolation options to run chaos or heavy integration suites with bounded concurrency, preventing spurious timeout failures under heavy load.
